                    "linkHoverColor": "#514293",
                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "If you use Inkwell’s CRM connection, <strong>add Inkwell to your approved list before your date</strong>. If you don’t, syncing and publishing could stop without warning.",
